    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Star Detective Precure!",
        "jpn": "名探偵プリキュア！"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Anna Akechi is a 14-year-old second-year middle school student living in Makoto Mirai City!\r\n\r\nGuided by a fairy named Pochitan who appeared on her birthday in her room with a pendant, she travels back in time from 2027 to Makoto Mirai City in 1999...!\r\n\r\nThere she meets Mikuru Kobayashi, a 14-year-old girl who dreams of becoming a star detective!\r\n\r\nSuddenly, an incident occurs!? It appears someone is in trouble after something important was stolen...?\r\n\r\nCould this incident be caused by the Phantom Thieves...?\r\n\r\nWe can't ignore people in trouble...! With that thought in mind, Anna and Mikuru transform into the Star Detective Precure!!\r\n\r\nThe Star Detective Pretty Cure will protect everyone's smiles with the power of deduction!\r\n\r\nSolve that mystery! Cure It!\r\n\r\nAnd will Anna be able to return to her original time period...!? The 23rd entry in Toei Animation’s Pretty Cure series.",
        "jpn": "【明智あんな】は、マコトミライタウンに暮らす14歳の中学２年生！\r\n誕生日に現れた妖精【ポチタン】とお部屋にあったペンダントに導かれて\r\n2027年から1999年のまことみらい市にタイムスリップ…！\r\n\r\nそこで出会ったのは、名探偵に憧れている14歳の女の子【小林みくる】！\r\n\r\nそんな中、事件発生！？\r\n大切なものを盗まれて困っている人がいるみたい…！\r\n事件は【怪盗団ファントム】のしわざ…！？\r\n困っている人を見逃せない…！\r\nそんな思いから、あんなとみくるは【名探偵プリキュア】に\r\n変身‼ \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n名探偵プリキュアがみんなの笑顔を推理で守る！\r\n\r\n「そのナゾ！キュアット解決！」\r\n\r\nそして、あんなは元の時代に戻ることができるのか…！？"
    },
